---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Approach" description="Why GreaterThan works as an independent practice, and how every engagement is run.">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero hero--sub section--indigo">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>How GreaterThan works</h1>
    <p class="lead">Independent, senior, advice built around your business strategy.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY INDEPENDENT -->
<section class="about-content-section section--light">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">Why independent consulting</h2>
    <p class="reveal d1">Agencies by nature, are solving for what they have to sell. As an independent, I'm solving for what my client's business actually needs. The difference is everything.</p>
    <p class="reveal d2">Independence means no inventory to sell, no account team to bill, no pressure to add scope. It means looking at the business honestly and recommending what it actually needs, whether that's a big project or a simple strategic conversation.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- APPROACH -->
<section class="about-content-section" id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">Approach</h2>
    <p class="reveal d1">Every engagement begins by reading the business. Where it's heading, who the customers actually are, what the marketing currently delivers against what's needed. The work that follows is shaped by what you find, not by what was expected when you walked in.</p>
    <p class="reveal d2">What holds true is the principle: your marketing must serve your business strategy. It exists to advance your business objectives, to deliver results for what you're trying to achieve. That's its only purpose. Everything flows from that.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <h2>Want to work <em>together</em>?</h2>
      <div class="cta-band__right">
        <span class="cta-band__email">hello@wearegreaterthan.co.nz</span>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary-dark">Book a discovery call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
